<title>USA: Electronic Clearing adopts rights plan.</title>
<headline>Electronic Clearing adopts rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>AGOURA HILLS, Calif. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Clearing House Inc said Thursday it adopted a shareholder rights plan.</p>
<p>The company said a dividend of one preferred share purchase right would be distributed for each share of common stock held as of September 30. Each right will bear the right to purchase one one-hundredth of a share of Series A Junior Participating preferred stock if the plan is effected.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the specifics of how the plan would be effected and was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
